	Fix of the SMHI data cleaning script

	* scripts/clean_data.sh: Find the "Datum" header line in every file
	instead of skipping a fixed number of lines. Extract datasets.tgz,
	create the output folders and add a plausibility check (-55 to +40 C).

2026-10-29  Ewucok  

	* Data Preprocessing: Cleaned the data and executed a Python utility script to convert raw SMHI Lund CSV data into the required space-separated daily-mean .dat format.

	* ROOT Macro (`macros/MeanAnnualTempLund.C`): 
	  - New ROOT macro. 
	  - Calculates annual mean temperatures
